menu "Control protocol"
    config CONTROL_MOTION_WINDOW_MAX
        int "Maximum negotiated browser motion commands"
        range 1 5 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S31
        range 1 3 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32C3
        range 1 4
        default 3 if IDF_TARGET_ESP32S31 || IDF_TARGET_ESP32C3
        default 1
        help
            Maximum number of outstanding relative movement commands on a
            negotiated browser WebSocket. A maximum of one preserves the
            target's legacy channel without advertising the motion window.
            The adapter's active-request capacity must support the selected maximum.
endmenu
